      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i know i should probably see someone but i've just been so busy and honestly i don't have the time to sit in an ER for 8 hours right now. i just want to know if there is something i can take or do right now to make this feeling go away so i can get through the rest of my shift. is there like an antacid or something that helps with this kind of tension?",
