      "content": "gabapentin?? i dont think i can go get a prescription for that right now lol. i just need something i have in my cabinet. honestly i really think this is just my nerves acting up cuz of this big project im finishing. if i just took a couple extra ibuprofen and some deep breaths, do u think that would settle the chest tightness enough to get me through the day? i really dont want to go to the hospital over what is probably just a panic attack.",
